request.description:
Roles: any (must be logged in)

Field name must be 'files'.

Response:
{
  "data": { "url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/...", "publicId": "genius_rx/uuid-filename" }
}

Use the url and publicId in:
- Avatar: PATCH /user/:id  { avatar: { url } }
- Resume: POST /resume  { file: { url, publicId } }
- Message attachment: POST /message  { attachments: [{ url, type }] }

