request.description:
Roles: none (public)

Returns full job details PLUS recruiterProfile for the 'About Company' section.

Response includes:
- recruiterId: { name, email, avatar, role }
- recruiterProfile: { companyName, location, aboutCompany, socialLinks, ... }

recruitedProfile is null if recruiter hasn't set up company profile yet.

